    "    * **Hypothesis:** Among the household types examined, one-family households are expected to have the largest difference between the highest and lowest area percentages paying at least $400 per week. This is expected across both Australian remoteness categories and New Zealand regional councils.\n",
    "\n",
    "3. **Research Question 3:**\n",
